        <div class="faq-q">What is knowledge management? <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></div>
        <div class="faq-a">Knowledge management is the process of creating, organising, maintaining, and distributing information so that the right people can find the right answers at the right time. It reduces support load, speeds up onboarding, and keeps teams aligned.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">Can you build a knowledge base from scratch? <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></div>
        <div class="faq-a">Yes. We handle everything from information architecture and platform setup to writing every article. We can start from a blank slate or migrate and restructure existing content.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">Can you improve an existing knowledge base? <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></div>
        <div class="faq-a">Absolutely. We audit your existing content, identify gaps and outdated articles, restructure the navigation, improve search performance, and rewrite content to meet a consistent standard.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
