        <div class="faq-a">We establish governance frameworks, content ownership models, review schedules, and maintenance plans. We also offer ongoing retainer arrangements to keep your knowledge base current as your product changes.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-q">Do you work with both customer-facing and internal knowledge bases? <svg class="faq-chevron" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg></div>
        <div class="faq-a">Yes. We build customer-facing help centres, internal wikis, employee handbooks, SOPs, and team documentation. The principles are the same, the audience and tone are adjusted accordingly.</div>
